.TH SANCHALA-AI 1 "August 2026" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-ai \- Local AI assistant for Sanchala OS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-ai
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sanchala-ai
provides local, privacy-respecting AI capabilities including chat,
OCR, smart suggestions, and system assistance. All processing runs
locally using llama.cpp with no cloud dependency.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B chat \fR[\fIMESSAGE\fR]
Interactive chat or single query
.TP
.B models
List and manage AI models
.TP
.B status
Show AI service status
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-m, \-\-model \fINAME\fR
Select model to use
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output in JSON format
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.SH RELATED COMMANDS
.TP
.B sanchala-ocr \fIIMAGE\fR
Extract text from images
.TP
.B sanchala-suggest \fIQUERY\fR
Get smart search suggestions
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/ai/ai.toml
Configuration file
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/sanchala-ai/models/
User model storage
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sanchala-ocr (1),
.BR sanchala-suggest (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team <dev@sanchala.id>
